  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760367,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Fat 2 Fuck: A Commodore 64 Oddity\n\nPrepare for a bizarre and controversial experience with *2 Fat 2 Fuck*, a notoriously unusual Commodore 64 game. This side-scrolling action platformer casts you as two obese, anthropomorphic pigs, Porky and Harry, trapped within a bizarre, surreal world. Their predicament? They’ve consumed so much that they’re literally too fat to move quickly, leading to a frantic, comical struggle for survival.\n\nGameplay revolves around navigating treacherous levels filled with bizarre enemies and obstacles, all while managing your characters' ever-increasing weight. Collecting food, ironically, makes you *slower*, demanding strategic choices. Porky and Harry possess unique abilities – Porky can jump higher, while Harry is stronger – requiring cooperative play (or solo mastery of both). \n\nThe game's humor is dark and satirical, pushing boundaries with its unusual premise and visuals. Expect a challenging, unconventional platforming experience unlike anything else on the Commodore 64, wrapped in a package that’s as memorable as it is peculiar."
    },
